	  occupies the former append journal. Only a freshly generated identity
	  and its verified NVS nonce and contact records may become active.
	  Existing legacy identities and scalar restoration are unavailable.

config MT_RF_ADMIN_GET
	bool "Authenticated private RF Admin responder"
	depends on MT_PKI_TARGET_RUNTIME
	default n
	help
	  Answer bounded owner/config/module/channel GETs for a current explicitly
	  authorized public Admin key. The same opt-in supports peer/key-bound
	  session-passkey SETs for owner, device/network, MQTT and channel settings,
	  deferred until authenticated RX/storage pause restoration. Uses existing
	  replay/nonce and typed settings journals; no private identity, Admin-key,
	  LoRa or legacy shared-admin-channel mutation. Requires the independent
	  Admin-key journal and production owner callbacks. Recovery may omit it.

